        "sections": [
          {
            "section_type": "example_question",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Simplify <span class=\"math\">[MATH: (4+c)\\cdot 3-8.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "Simplify [MATH: (4+c)\\cdot 3-8.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>EXPLANATION</p>",
            "readable_text": "EXPLANATION",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>First, we distribute the <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 3]</span> over each of the terms in parentheses.</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\eqalign{\n(4+c)\\cdot 3-8 &amp;= \\[5pt]\n4\\cdot3+c\\cdot 3-8 &amp;= \\[5pt]\n(12)+(3c)-8 &amp;= \\[5pt]\n12+3c-8 &amp;\n}]</span></p><p>Then, we collect like terms.</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\eqalign{\n12+3c-8 &amp;= \\[5pt]\n3c +(12-8)&amp;= \\[5pt]\n3c+4\n}]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "First, we distribute the [MATH: 3] over each of the terms in parentheses.\n\n[MATH: \\eqalign{\n(4+c)\\cdot 3-8 &= \\[5pt]\n4\\cdot3+c\\cdot 3-8 &= \\[5pt]\n(12)+(3c)-8 &= \\[5pt]\n12+3c-8 &\n}]\n\nThen, we collect like terms.\n\n[MATH: \\eqalign{\n12+3c-8 &= \\[5pt]\n3c +(12-8)&= \\[5pt]\n3c+4\n}]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
        "images": [],
        "free_entry_blanks": [],
        "select_lists": [],
        "readable_text": "Example Prompt:\nSimplify [MATH: (4+c)\\cdot 3-8.]\n\nContent:\nEXPLANATION\n\nExplanation:\nFirst, we distribute the [MATH: 3] over each of the terms in parentheses.\n\n[MATH: \\eqalign{\n(4+c)\\cdot 3-8 &= \\[5pt]\n4\\cdot3+c\\cdot 3-8 &= \\[5pt]\n(12)+(3c)-8 &= \\[5pt]\n12+3c-8 &\n}]\n\nThen, we collect like terms.\n\n[MATH: \\eqalign{\n12+3c-8 &= \\[5pt]\n3c +(12-8)&= \\[5pt]\n3c+4\n}]"
      },
