            "normalized_html": "<p>First, we distribute the <span class=\"math\">[MATH: (-4)]</span> over each of the terms in parentheses.</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: (\u2212 4)(8x + 7y) + 30y|=; (\u2212 4) \u22c5 8x + (\u2212 4) \u22c5 7y + 30y|=; (\u2212 32x) + (\u2212 28y) + 30y|=; \u2212 32x \u2212 28y + 30y]</span></p><p>Then, we collect like terms.</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: \u2212 32x \u2212 28y + 30y|=; \u2212 32x + (\u2212 28y + 30y)|=; \u2212 32x + 2y]</span></p>",
