            "normalized_html": "<p>First, we distribute the <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 3]</span> over each of the terms in parentheses.</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: (5 \u2212 y) \u22c5 3 \u2212 10|=; 5 \u22c5 3 + (\u2212 y) \u22c5 3 \u2212 10|=; (15) + (\u2212 3y) \u2212 10|=; 15 \u2212 3y \u2212 10]</span></p><p>Then, we collect like terms.</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: 15 \u2212 3y \u2212 10|=; (15 \u2212 10) \u2212 3y|=; 5 \u2212 3y]</span></p>",
